      "blurb": "Elite Cerberus operative with phase cloaking and advanced augmentations",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Phantoms are Cerberus's most accomplished close-quarters operatives, augmented beyond standard military parameters with phase cloaking systems and neural acceleration that makes them faster and more precise than unaugmented humans. They deploy as surgical strike elements—appearing, eliminating high-value targets, and withdrawing before countermeasures can be organized. Their cloaking system is imperfect under sustained fire but provides a decisive advantage at the initiation of contact.</p><p><strong>Phase Cloak (1 action):</strong> The phantom activates their cloaking system, becoming invisible until the start of their next turn or until they make a Strike (whichever comes first).</p><p><strong>Kinetic Barrier:</strong> 60 Shield HP. Recharges 15 HP per turn.</p>",
